{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00701","headline":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 雍和 · 郑善玉","name":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酌郁既灌，芗萧方爇。\n笾豆静器，簠簋芬飶。\n鱼腊荐美，牲牷表洁。\n是戢是将，载迎载列。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑善玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}